	(text
		"B. BATTERY (1 x 18650 Li-ion) + PROTECTION + SENSING"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 232.62 139.38 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "d04d0934-8bba-499a-a424-a745ec9155be")
	)
	(text
		"DW01A + FS8205 cut the cell off below 2.4 V, above 4.3 V, on over-current (~3 A) and short circuit.\nBoard ground is the protected P- side; BATN is the cell minus. VSYS = cell + (3.0-4.2 V) feeds the\nmodem directly (SIMCom reference design: no regulator, no diodes), the 3.3 V LDO and the 12 V boost.\nBAT_V = VSYS / 2 (470k/470k, 4.5 uA). TH101 sits under the cell; its divider is powered from +3V3_SW\nso it draws nothing while the sensors are off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 232.62 143.38 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "d4b79bf4-34a1-4b72-90f7-3e37330f250c")
	)
