	)
	(text
		"Powered straight from the cell (VSYS) through FB301: SIMCom reference for a 1-cell Li-ion supply. 470 uF low-ESR\nplus 22u/1u/100n/33p/10p near the VBAT pins (route VBAT >= 2 mm wide). D301 clamps surges.\nPWRKEY and RESET are driven by MMBT3904s (SIMCom figures 10 and 13: 4.7k base, 47k pull-down), so the\nmodem stays OFF until the firmware presses PWRKEY. UART level shifters: SIMCom figure 16 (MMBT3904, 4.7k, 1 nF).\nRI goes to an RTC pin of the ESP32 so it can sleep and wake on every incoming MQTT message.\nGNSS, audio, SPI, camera and keypad pins are not used and stay unconnected (not drawn on the symbol)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.62 440.56 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "49826527-a6a2-4706-8dae-7e08b2b495aa")
	)
