		(uuid "3a4f0c13-d478-40ca-b2c1-2fdc0df95371")
	)
	(text
		"FIELD EYES v2 - solar soil-monitoring node with latching valve control"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "9111decc-519b-4348-883c-82ef391dc37c")
	)
	(text
		"POWER TREE\n  6 V panel (1-2 W) -> CN3791 MPPT charger -> 18650 cell (DW01A/FS8205 protection) = VSYS 3.0-4.2 V\n  VSYS -> A7672S VBAT directly (2 A bursts)      VSYS -> XC6220 -> +3V3 (ESP32, always on)\n  +3V3 -> AO3401A (SENS_EN) -> +3V3_SW (RS485, DHT22, NTC)\n  VSYS -> AO3401A (SENS_EN) -> MT3608 -> +12V_SENS (soil sensors) -> 78L05 -> +5V_SENS (MAX485) and -> 78L09 -> 8.7 V valve reservoir (MX1508)\n\nWHAT CHANGED FROM THE OLD BOARD (security.sch)\n  - MP2338 buck, LM1117 and the D6/D7 diode drop removed: the modem runs straight from the cell.\n  - Solar MPPT charging and cell protection added; battery voltage, temperature and charge state readable.\n  - PWRKEY no longer tied to GND (the modem can stay off); RI wired for wake-on-message.\n  - ESP32 TX -> modem RX connection fixed (Q2 collector was not connected).\n  - RS485 keeps the MAX485ESA+T (5 V from a 78L05 on the sensor rail); sensors and RS485 switched off between readings.\n  - The valve driver chip (MX1508, from the mini-L298N module) is on the board; screw terminals for field cables.\n  - EN reset delay and auto-reset programming added; GNSS antenna dropped (location is fixed in firmware).\n\nPCB LAYOUT NOTES\n  - Solid ground plane on the bottom layer; keep the CN3791 loop (Q102, D101, D102, L101, C101) and the MT3608 loop tight.\n  - VSYS -> FB301 -> modem VBAT: >= 2 mm wide, C301-C306 at the VBAT pins. Cell holder close to the modem.\n  - RF_ANT -> J301: 50 ohm coplanar trace, as short as possible, ground vias along both sides.\n  - Keep the ESP32 antenna end over a board edge with no copper underneath (or cut-out).\n  - TH101 under the 18650; SM712s right at the screw terminals; C403 and U403 next to the valve terminal."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 36 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "477c7af0-a18e-4811-a60d-8500584d7828")
	)
